<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-bs-theme="light">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CSM Survey - CSPC</title>

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/canvas-confetti@1.5.1/dist/confetti.browser.min.js"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            transition: color 0.3s ease-in-out;
        }

        #sqd-body td {
            padding-top: 1.25rem;
            padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }

        .bg-blurred {
            position: fixed; 
            top: -5%; left: -5%; right: -5%; bottom: -5%; 
            background-image: url('https://spims.cspc.edu.ph/assets/img/background.jpg'); 
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            filter: blur(1px); 
            z-index: -1;
        }

        .bg-overlay {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); 
            z-index: -1;
        }

        .page { display: none; }
        .active { display: block; animation: fadeIn .4s ease; }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        .radio-custom {
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            accent-color: #0d6efd;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .survey-card {
            border-radius: 20px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95) !important;
            backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            transition: background 0.3s ease-in-out, border-color 0.3s ease-in-out;
        }

        .section-title {
            border-left: 5px solid #0d6efd;
            padding-left: 12px;
        }

        .option-card {
            border: 1px solid #dee2e6;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 14px;
            transition: .2s;
            cursor: pointer;
            background: white;
        }

        .option-card:hover {
            background: #eff6ff;
            border-color: #0d6efd;
        }

        .table td, .table th { vertical-align: middle; }
        textarea { resize: none; }

        /* --- DARK MODE STYLES --- */
        [data-bs-theme="dark"] body { color: #f8f9fa; }
        [data-bs-theme="dark"] .survey-card { background: rgba(33, 37, 41, 0.85) !important; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); }
        [data-bs-theme="dark"] .text-dark { color: #f8f9fa !important; }
        [data-bs-theme="dark"] .bg-light { background-color: #2b3035 !important; border-color: #495057 !important; }
        [data-bs-theme="dark"] .bg-white { background-color: #212529 !important; }
        [data-bs-theme="dark"] .option-card { background: #2b3035; border-color: #495057; color: #f8f9fa; }
        [data-bs-theme="dark"] .option-card:hover { background: #343a40; border-color: #0d6efd; }
        [data-bs-theme="dark"] .bg-primary-subtle { background-color: rgba(13, 110, 253, 0.2) !important; }
        [data-bs-theme="dark"] .form-select, [data-bs-theme="dark"] .form-control { background-color: #2b3035; color: #f8f9fa; border-color: #495057; }
        [data-bs-theme="dark"] .table { --bs-table-bg: transparent; --bs-table-color: #f8f9fa; border-color: #495057; }
        [data-bs-theme="dark"] .text-secondary { color: #adb5bd !important; }
        [data-bs-theme="dark"] #terms-box { background-color: #2b3035 !important; border-color: #495057 !important; }

        summary { list-style: none; outline: none; }
        summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
    </style>
</head>

<body class="py-3 py-md-5">

<div class="bg-blurred"></div>
<div class="bg-overlay"></div>

<div class="container">
    <div class="card shadow-lg border-0 survey-card">
        <div class="card-body p-3 p-md-5 position-relative">

            <div class="position-absolute top-0 start-0 m-3 z-3">
                <button id="btn-theme" type="button" onclick="toggleTheme()" class="btn bg-transparent border-0 text-body shadow-none fw-bold d-flex align-items-center gap-1">
                    🌙 Dark
                </button>
            </div>

            <div class="position-absolute top-0 end-0 m-3 d-flex gap-2 z-3">
                <button id="btn-en" type="button" onclick="setLanguage('en')" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm fw-bold shadow-sm">English</button>
                <button id="btn-tl" type="button" onclick="setLanguage('tl')" class="btn bg-transparent border btn-sm fw-bold shadow-sm text-body">Tagalog</button>
            </div>

            <div class="text-center border-bottom pb-4 mb-5 pt-5 pt-md-4">
                <div class="mb-3">
                    <img src="https://cspc.edu.ph/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Camarines_Sur_Polytechnic_Colleges_Logo.png" alt="CSPC Logo" style="width: 100px; height: auto; background-color: white; border-radius: 50%; padding: 3px;" class="mb-2 shadow-sm">
                </div>
                <p class="small text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" data-i18n="gov_rep">Republic of the Philippines</p>
                <h3 class="fw-bold text-uppercase mb-0 text-dark">Camarines Sur Polytechnic Colleges</h3>
                <p class="text-muted fst-italic">Nabua, Camarines Sur</p>

                <div class="bg-primary-subtle border rounded-4 p-3 mt-4">
                    <h4 class="fw-bold text-primary text-uppercase mb-0" data-i18n="form_title">Client Satisfaction Measurement (CSM) Survey</h4>
                </div>
            </div>

            <form id="surveyForm">

                <div id="stage1" class="page active">
                    <div class="bg-light border rounded-4 p-4 text-center mb-4">
                        <h4 class="fw-bold text-primary mb-3" data-i18n="s1_head">Help us serve you better!</h4>
                        <p class="text-secondary mb-0 fs-6" data-i18n="s1_desc"></p>
                    </div>

                    <div id="terms-box" class="mb-4 bg-white border border-secondary-subtle rounded-4 p-4 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="text-center mb-3">
                            <span class="fw-bold text-primary fs-5" data-i18n="terms_title">Terms and Conditions</span>
                            <p class="text-secondary small mb-0 mt-2" data-i18n="terms_summary"></p>
                        </div>

                        <ul id="terms-points-list" class="text-secondary small mb-3 ps-4"></ul>

                        <div class="text-center mb-3">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm fw-bold" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#termsModal" title="Read the full Terms and Conditions / Privacy Policy">
                                <span data-i18n="terms_read_btn"></span>
                            </button>
                        </div>

                        <div class="form-check d-flex align-items-start gap-2 justify-content-center border-top pt-3">
                            <input class="form-check-input mt-1" type="checkbox" id="agreeTermsStage1">
                            <label class="form-check-label text-dark fs-6" for="agreeTermsStage1">
                                <span data-i18n="terms_checkbox">I Agree to the Terms &amp; Conditions and Privacy Policy</span>
                            </label>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <button type="button" id="btnStartSurvey" onclick="navigate(2)" class="btn btn-primary w-100 py-3 fw-bold shadow-sm" disabled>
                        <span data-i18n="btn_start"></span>
                    </button>
                </div>

                <div id="stage2" class="page">
                    <div class="section-title mb-4">
                        <h4 class="fw-bold text-primary text-uppercase mb-0" data-i18n="client_prof">Client Profile</h4>
                    </div>

                    <div class="row g-4">
                        <!-- IDINAGDAG: Pangalan -->
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fw-semibold text-dark fs-6">Name / Pangalan (Optional)</label>
                            <input type="text" name="respondent_name" class="form-control border-secondary-subtle" placeholder="e.g. Juan Dela Cruz">
                        </div>

                        <!-- Signed-in Google account (used to enforce 1 survey per office) -->
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fw-semibold text-dark fs-6">Google Account</label>
                            <input type="email" name="email" class="form-control border-secondary-subtle" value="<%= typeof clientEmail !== 'undefined' ? clientEmail : '' %>" readonly>
                        </div>

                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fw-semibold text-dark fs-6" data-i18n="lbl_client_type"></label>
                            <!-- IDINAGDAG ANG name="client_type" AT value="" -->
                            <select name="client_type" class="form-select border-secondary-subtle">
                                <option value="Citizen" data-i18n="opt_citizen"></option>
                                <option value="Business" data-i18n="opt_business"></option>
                                <option value="Government" data-i18n="opt_gov"></option>
                            </select>
                        </div>

                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fw-semibold text-dark fs-6" data-i18n="lbl_sex"></label>
                            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-2">
                                <label class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 text-dark">
                                    <!-- PINALITAN ANG name="sex" NG name="gender" AT NAGDAGDAG NG value="Male" -->
                                    <input type="radio" name="gender" value="Male" class="radio-custom">
                                    <span data-i18n="lbl_male"></span>
                                </label>
                                <label class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 text-dark">
                                    <!-- PINALITAN ANG name="sex" NG name="gender" AT NAGDAGDAG NG value="Female" -->
                                    <input type="radio" name="gender" value="Female" class="radio-custom">
                                    <span data-i18n="lbl_female"></span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fw-semibold text-dark fs-6" data-i18n="lbl_age"></label>
                            <!-- IDINAGDAG ANG name="age" AT value="" SA MGA OPTIONS -->
                            <select name="age" class="form-select border-secondary-subtle">
                                <option value="" selected disabled data-i18n="opt_sel_age"></option>
                                <option value="18 and below" data-i18n="opt_18_below"></option>
                                <option value="19-24">19-24</option>
                                <option value="25-39">25-39</option>
                                <option value="40-59">40-59</option>
                                <option value="60 and above" data-i18n="opt_60_above"></option>
                            </select>
                        </div>

                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fw-semibold text-dark fs-6" data-i18n="lbl_date"></label>
                            <input type="date" id="surveyDate" name="survey_date" class="form-control border-secondary-subtle">
                        </div>

                        <div class="col-12">
                            <label class="form-label fw-semibold text-dark fs-6" data-i18n="lbl_region"></label>
                            <!-- IDINAGDAG ANG name="region" AT value="" SA MGA OPTIONS -->
                            <select name="region" class="form-select border-secondary-subtle">
                                <option value="" disabled selected data-i18n="opt_select_region"></option>
                                <option value="NCR - National Capital Region">NCR - National Capital Region</option>
                                <option value="CAR - Cordillera Administrative Region">CAR - Cordillera Administrative Region</option>
                                <option value="Region I - Ilocos Region">Region I - Ilocos Region</option>
                                <option value="Region II - Cagayan Valley">Region II - Cagayan Valley</option>
                                <option value="Region III - Central Luzon">Region III - Central Luzon</option>
                                <option value="Region IV-A - CALABARZON">Region IV-A - CALABARZON</option>
                                <option value="MIMAROPA Region">MIMAROPA Region</option>
                                <option value="Region V - Bicol Region">Region V - Bicol Region</option>
                                <option value="Region VI - Western Visayas">Region VI - Western Visayas</option>
                                <option value="Region VII - Central Visayas">Region VII - Central Visayas</option>
                                <option value="Region VIII - Eastern Visayas">Region VIII - Eastern Visayas</option>
                                <option value="Region IX - Zamboanga Peninsula">Region IX - Zamboanga Peninsula</option>
                                <option value="Region X - Northern Mindanao">Region X - Northern Mindanao</option>
                                <option value="Region XI - Davao Region">Region XI - Davao Region</option>
                                <option value="Region XII - SOCCSKSARGEN">Region XII - SOCCSKSARGEN</option>
                                <option value="Region XIII - Caraga">Region XIII - Caraga</option>
                                <option value="BARMM - Bangsamoro">BARMM - Bangsamoro Autonomous Region in Muslim Mindanao</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>

                        <div class="col-12">
                            <label class="form-label fw-semibold text-dark fs-6" data-i18n="lbl_office"></label>
                            <select name="office_id" class="form-select fs-6" required>
                                <option value="" selected disabled data-i18n="s1_ph">Select Office...</option>
                                <% if (typeof offices !== 'undefined') { %>
                                    <% const taken = typeof takenOfficeIds !== 'undefined' ? takenOfficeIds : []; %>
                                    <% offices.forEach(office => { %>
                                        <% const isTaken = taken.includes(office.id); %>
                                        <option value="<%= office.id %>" <%= isTaken ? 'disabled' : '' %>><%= office.office_name %> (<%= office.cluster_name %>)<%= isTaken ? ' (Already Completed)' : '' %></option>
                                    <% }); %>
                                <% } %>
                            </select>
                        </div>

                        <div class="col-12">
                            <label class="form-label fw-semibold text-dark fs-6" data-i18n="lbl_service"></label>
                            <input type="text" name="service_availed" class="form-control border-secondary-subtle">
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between border-top pt-4 mt-5">
                        <button type="button" onclick="navigate(1)" class="btn btn-outline-secondary fw-bold" data-i18n="btn_back"></button>
                        <button type="button" onclick="navigate(3)" class="btn btn-primary fw-bold px-5 shadow-sm" data-i18n="btn_next"></button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div id="stage3" class="page">
                    <div class="section-title mb-4">
                        <h4 class="fw-bold text-primary text-uppercase mb-0" data-i18n="cc_title"></h4>
                        <p class="text-secondary mt-2 mb-2" data-i18n="cc_desc"></p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-light border rounded-4 p-4 mb-4">
                        <p class="fw-bold text-dark" data-i18n="cc1_q"></p>
                        <div class="d-grid gap-3">
                            <label class="option-card d-flex gap-3 text-dark">
                                <input type="radio" name="cc1" value="I know what a CC is and I saw this office's CC." class="radio-custom mt-1">
                                <span data-i18n="cc1_1"></span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="option-card d-flex gap-3 text-dark">
                                <input type="radio" name="cc1" value="I know what a CC is but I did not see this office's CC." class="radio-custom mt-1">
                                <span data-i18n="cc1_2"></span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="option-card d-flex gap-3 text-dark">
                                <input type="radio" name="cc1" value="I learned of the CC only when I saw this office's CC." class="radio-custom mt-1">
                                <span data-i18n="cc1_3"></span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="option-card d-flex gap-3 text-dark">
                                <input type="radio" name="cc1" value="I do not know what a CC is and I did not see one in this office" class="radio-custom mt-1">
                                <span data-i18n="cc1_4"></span>
                            </label>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-light border rounded-4 p-4 mb-4">
                        <p class="fw-bold text-dark" data-i18n="cc2_q"></p>
                        <div class="row g-3">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="option-card d-flex gap-3 align-items-center text-dark">
                                    <input type="radio" name="cc2" value="Easy to see" class="radio-custom">
                                    <span data-i18n="cc2_1"></span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="option-card d-flex gap-3 align-items-center text-dark">
                                    <input type="radio" name="cc2" value="Somewhat easy to see" class="radio-custom">
                                    <span data-i18n="cc2_2"></span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="option-card d-flex gap-3 align-items-center text-dark">
                                    <input type="radio" name="cc2" value="Difficult to see" class="radio-custom">
                                    <span data-i18n="cc2_3"></span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="option-card d-flex gap-3 align-items-center text-dark">
                                    <input type="radio" name="cc2" value="Not visible at all" class="radio-custom">
                                    <span data-i18n="cc2_4"></span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12">
                                <label class="option-card d-flex gap-3 align-items-center text-dark">
                                    <input type="radio" name="cc2" value="N/A" class="radio-custom">
                                    <span data-i18n="cc2_5"></span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-light border rounded-4 p-4">
                        <p class="fw-bold text-dark" data-i18n="cc3_q"></p>
                        <div class="row g-3">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="option-card d-flex gap-3 align-items-center text-dark">
                                    <input type="radio" name="cc3" value="Helped very much" class="radio-custom">
                                    <span data-i18n="cc3_1"></span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="option-card d-flex gap-3 align-items-center text-dark">
                                    <input type="radio" name="cc3" value="Did not help" class="radio-custom">
                                    <span data-i18n="cc3_2"></span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="option-card d-flex gap-3 align-items-center text-dark">
                                    <input type="radio" name="cc3" value="Somewhat helped" class="radio-custom">
                                    <span data-i18n="cc3_3"></span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="option-card d-flex gap-3 align-items-center text-dark">
                                    <input type="radio" name="cc3" value="N/A" class="radio-custom">
                                    <span data-i18n="cc3_4"></span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between border-top pt-4 mt-5">
                        <button type="button" onclick="navigate(2)" class="btn btn-outline-secondary fw-bold" data-i18n="btn_back"></button>
                        <button type="button" onclick="navigate(4)" class="btn btn-primary fw-bold px-5 shadow-sm" data-i18n="btn_next"></button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div id="stage4" class="page">
                    <div class="section-title mb-4">
                        <h4 class="fw-bold text-primary text-uppercase mb-0" data-i18n="sqd_title"></h4>
                        <p class="text-secondary mt-2 mb-0" data-i18n="sqd_desc"></p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="table-responsive border rounded-4 bg-white">
                        <table class="table table-bordered align-middle mb-0">
                            <thead class="table-dark text-center">
                            <tr>
                                <th class="text-start" data-i18n="th_statement"></th>
                                <th>🤩 5<br><small data-i18n="th_sa"></small></th>
                                <th>😊 4<br><small data-i18n="th_a"></small></th>
                                <th>😐 3<br><small data-i18n="th_n"></small></th>
                                <th>☹️ 2<br><small data-i18n="th_d"></small></th>
                                <th>😡 1<br><small data-i18n="th_sd"></small></th>
                                <th>N/A</th>
                            </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody id="sqd-body"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-4">
                        <label class="form-label fw-semibold fst-italic text-dark" data-i18n="lbl_sugg"></label>
                        <textarea name="comments" class="form-control border-secondary-subtle" rows="5"></textarea>
                    </div>

                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between border-top pt-4 mt-5">
                        <button type="button" onclick="navigate(3)" class="btn btn-outline-secondary fw-bold" data-i18n="btn_back"></button>
                        <button type="button" onclick="submitAll(event)" class="btn btn-primary fw-bold px-5 shadow-sm" data-i18n="btn_submit"></button>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </form>
            <div id="thank-you-page" class="page text-center py-5">
                <div class="bg-success-subtle rounded-circle d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center mb-4" style="width:100px;height:100px;">
                    <span class="fs-1 text-success">✔</span>
                </div>
                <h1 class="fw-bold mb-3 text-dark" data-i18n="ty_title"></h1>
                <p class="text-secondary">
                    <span data-i18n="ty_desc"></span> <strong class="text-primary">CSPC</strong>
                </p>
                <button onclick="location.reload()" class="btn btn-outline-primary px-5 py-3 fw-bold mt-4" data-i18n="btn_again"></button>
                <div class="mt-3">
                    <button type="button" onclick="logout()" class="btn btn-outline-danger px-5 py-3 fw-bold">🚪 Logout</button>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Terms & Conditions / Privacy Policy Modal -->
<div class="modal fade" id="termsModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="termsModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-lg">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold" id="termsModalLabel">Terms &amp; Conditions / Privacy Policy</h5>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close" title="Close"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body" style="max-height: 60vh; overflow-y: auto; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6;">
                <h6 class="fw-bold">Privacy Policy</h6>
                <p>This privacy statement discloses the privacy practices of the Unified Information System (UnIS) and its sub-modules.</p>

                <h6 class="fw-bold mt-3">Information Collection and Use</h6>
                <p>UnIS is the sole owner of the information collected on this site. We will not sell, share, or rent this information to others in ways different from what is disclosed in this statement. UnIS collects information from our users at several different points on our Web application.</p>
                <p>In order to use some features of this web application, users must first complete the profiling form. During registration, users are required to give their personal and contact information (name and e-mail address), family background, and demographics. This information is used for academic purposes only.</p>

                <h6 class="fw-bold mt-3">Cookies</h6>
                <p>UnIS may use cookies to remember if users have logged in while on our site. This allows web site users to avoid logging in more than once, thereby saving time. Users have the option of disabling or not accepting cookies by changing the preferences on their browsers. If users opt to disable cookies, they will still be able to use our Web site. However, they will not be able to use some functionality or post to the message boards. No personally identifiable information (e-mail address, name, etc.) is collected with the cookies that we set. Accepting cookies while on the UnIS site will not put the user at risk for marketing to other sites.</p>

                <h6 class="fw-bold mt-3">Web Statistics</h6>
                <p>We use IP addresses to analyze trends, administer the site, track user movement, and gather broad demographic information for aggregate use for reporting purposes. IP addresses are not linked to personally identifiable information.</p>

                <h6 class="fw-bold mt-3">Sharing</h6>
                <p>We will not share any information to external organization except for government organization, administration and institutional researcher which is requirement for reporting and analytics purposes. This is not linked to any personal information that can identify any individual person. Data are shared to other institutional information system through a secured and authenticated API.</p>

                <h6 class="fw-bold mt-3">Security</h6>
                <p>This Web site takes every precaution to protect our users' information, and we have security measures in place to protect the loss, misuse, and alteration of the information under our control.</p>

                <h6 class="fw-bold mt-3">Updates</h6>
                <p>We may also send the user site and service announcement updates.</p>

                <h6 class="fw-bold mt-3">Data Privacy</h6>
                <p>All provisions of laws, administrative orders, circular, regulations, and other issuances inconsistent with this policy are hereby repealed or modified accordingly.</p>

                <h6 class="fw-bold mt-3">Notification of Changes</h6>
                <p>If we decide to change our privacy policy, we will post those changes on our home page so our users are always aware of what information we collect, how we use it, and under what circumstances, if any, we disclose it. If at any point we decide to use personally identifiable information in a manner different from that stated at the time it was collected, we will notify users by e-mail. Users will have a choice as to whether or not we use their information in this different manner. We will use information in accordance with the privacy policy under which the information was collected.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary px-4" data-bs-dismiss="modal" title="Close this dialog">I Understand</button>
